lib/
├── angle_utils/
│   ├── angle_utils.h
│   └── angle_utils.cpp   — clipAngleTo360, smallerAngleDifference, angleBisector
│                           No Arduino dependency. Safe to use in host-side tests.
│
└── light_ring/
    ├── light_ring.h
    └── light_ring.cpp    — MUX channel select, LDR sensor reads, findLine()
                            Depends on Arduino.h and angle_utils.
                            Pin definitions (M1, M2, S0-S3) are in light_ring.h.
                            Tuning constants are sourced from include/config.h.

Libraries here are compiled by PlatformIO and linked into whichever environment
includes them. Both libraries are available to layer1, layer2, and layer3.
